From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UnlimitedBytes <admin@unlimitedbytes.ovh>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 20:58:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add region-based player ticking infrastructure

- Add player tracking in LevelChunkRegion and LevelChunkRegionMap
- Create ConfettiPlayerTicker to tick player connections and chunk loaders
- Hook player ticking into ConfettiChunkTicker._tickRegion()
- Disable global RegionizedPlayerChunkLoader.tick() in favor of per-region
- Make PlayerChunkLoaderData.update() and updateQueues() public
- Add Connection.tick() guard to only tick on owning thread
- Add player add/remove hooks in ServerLevel EntityCallbacks

